This project is based on Claude Squad (https://github.com/smtg-ai/claude-squad),
Copyright (c) smtg-ai contributors, licensed under AGPL-3.0.

Substantial modifications have been made including:
- Multi-account credential management (separate `CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR` / `CODEX_HOME` per account)
- Usage tracking and routing (reads Claude Code `statusLine` data and Codex session JSONL files
  to track each account's 5-hour rate limit usage, routes tasks to the account with the most headroom)
- Model-aware task dispatch (selects the appropriate worker based on task type and model capability)
- Codex CLI integration alongside Claude Code
